[{"id":"05030001","s":"單一選擇題<br> 若　a、b、c　皆是整數，且　a<sup>2</sup>＋b<sup>2</sup>＋c<sup>2</sup>－ab－bc－ca＝1，則　a、b、c　任兩數的差不可能為下列何者？","o":["－1","0","1","2"],"a":3,"e":"原式等號兩邊同乘以　2<br>　2a<sup>2</sup>＋2b<sup>2</sup>＋2c<sup>2</sup>－2ab－2bc－2ca＝2<br>（a－b）<sup>2</sup>＋（b－c）<sup>2</sup>＋（c－a）<sup>2</sup>＝2<br>∵a、b、c　皆是整數<br>∴（a－b）<sup>2</sup>、（b－c）<sup>2</sup>、（c－a）<sup>2</sup>　只能是　1、1、0<br>故任兩數的差為±1　或　0<br>故選(Ｄ)","k":["差的平方公式"],"d":"難","html":1},{"id":"05030002","s":"下列各式中，何者與（－x＋y）<sup>2</sup>　的結果相同？","o":["－（x＋y）<sup>2</sup>","（x＋y）<sup>2</sup>","－（x－y）<sup>2</sup>","（x－y）<sup>2</sup>"],"a":3,"e":"（－x＋y）<sup>2</sup>＝〔－（x－y）〕<sup>2</sup>＝（x－y）<sup>2</sup><br>故選(Ｄ)","k":["分配律"],"d":"難","html":1},{"id":"05030003","s":"估算<img src=\"img/1-1_r0.svg\" width=\"30\" alt=\"附圖\">×889　的值最接近下列哪一個數？","o":["890","889","888","887"],"a":2,"e":"<img src=\"img/1-1_r1.svg\" width=\"30\" alt=\"附圖\">×889＝<img src=\"img/1-1_r2.svg\" width=\"96\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1-1_r3.svg\" width=\"120\" alt=\"附圖\">＝889－<img src=\"img/1-1_r4.svg\" width=\"30\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>由於<img src=\"img/1-1_r5.svg\" width=\"30\" alt=\"附圖\">≒1，則　889－<img src=\"img/1-1_r6.svg\" width=\"30\" alt=\"附圖\">≒889－1＝888<br>故其值最接近　888","k":["分配律"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05030004","s":"已知（30<img src=\"img/1-1_r7.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＝30<sup>2</sup>＋（<img src=\"img/1-1_r8.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＋c，則　c＝？","o":["<img src=\"img/1-1_r9.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">","15","30","60"],"a":1,"e":"（30<img src=\"img/1-1_r10.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＝（30＋<img src=\"img/1-1_r11.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＝30<sup>2</sup>＋2×30×<img src=\"img/1-1_r12.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">＋（<img src=\"img/1-1_r13.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup><br>＝30<sup>2</sup>＋15＋（<img src=\"img/1-1_r14.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＝30<sup>2</sup>＋（<img src=\"img/1-1_r15.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＋c<br>∴c＝15","k":["和的平方公式"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":